  "synonym_discrimination": {
    "words": [
      "large-adj",
      "big-adj"
    ],
    "note": "**Large** and **big** both describe size (*a large house*, *a big house*). **Large** is a little more formal and is the usual word with **amount**, **number**, and **quantity**. **Big** is more common in speech, and also means important (*a big decision*), which **large** usually does not."
  },
